//! Compile-time embedded public RSS resource catalog.
//!
//! The catalog is generated by `build.rs` from the checked-in `rss/` tree:
//! sorted original `rss/...` keys paired with compile-time `include_str!`
//! bytes. It is pure immutable public source inventory. It carries no
//! selection, default, provider, legacy, config, or credential policy, and it
//! re-reads no file, environment variable, or source root at runtime.

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/bundled_rss_sources.rs"));
